const STYLE_HELP = ["NATURAL: moves each note gently to the nearest true note and keeps your slides, scoops and vibrato. Best for roots reggae and soulful singing.",
  "POLISHED: notes land right in tune and long notes are held steady. Your vibrato stays. The modern radio sound.",
  "HARD TUNE: the robotic auto-tune effect. Notes snap instantly to the key and the wobble is removed. KEEP EXPRESSION and STEADY NOTES don't apply."];
